<title>KENYA: SOCCER-NAMIBIA BEAT KENYA 1-0 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NAMIBIA BEAT KENYA 1-0 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Namibia beat Kenya 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in an Africa Nations Cup group five qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Gervatius Urikhob 35</p>
<p>Attendance 20,000</p>
